/-
Suggested signatures for ColemanPowerSeries L0's unramified arithmetic refinement.
The reader document is the specification. These prototypes suggest interfaces,
not an exhaustive implementation checklist. Proof placeholders establish no
formalization claim. The accepted parent packet supplies the base tower.

The pin has no canonical finite-extension structure supplier, unramified-field
Frobenius interface, or native pro-p scalar/completed-action module. The real
local-field structures below are parameters supplied by LocalFieldsRamification;
their arithmetic compatibility is stated explicitly, never replaced by a free
Prop field. Missing current-only interfaces are listed at the end and in gap G1.
-/
